24,"text":"is one of the most popular festivals in Scotland. It"},{"w":0.37242797851562498,"text":"brings over 20,000 people to the area to enjoy the","x":0.084362146153710058,"y":0.30959302320342164,"h":0.01162790690711013},{"text":"delicious food and drink. It takes place every year","w":0.37448557535807292,"y":0.32412790714854922,"x":0.084362155273638342,"h":0.013081394896215404},{"h":0.013343799058084804,"y":0.34144426974020237,"text":"in September and lasts two days. You can try and","x":0.080246909188328081,"w":0.37654320610894099},{"w":0.3888888888888889,"text":"buy local food and traditional Scottish food. There is","x":0.084362134327846547,"h":0.011627906907110019,"y":0.35901162813559229},{"h":0.011627906907110019,"text":"a Continental Market with foods from many different","x":0.082304539798940562,"y":0.37499999996214262,"w":0.39094648573133683},{"text":"countries in Europe too. You can also watch top","x":0.082304545765482795,"y":0.39244186069373188,"w":0.358024664984809,"h":0.01179675778938416},{"text":"chefs prepare food. It's free!","y":0.40843023266563105,"w":0.21604938083224826,"h":0.011627906907109908,"x":0.082304524990254507},{"x":0.080246922483402414,"text":"The Cheshire Food Festival","h":0.021802325825114877,"w":0.39917694091796874,"y":0.45784883700750068},{"x":0.080246918323406871,"w":0.32921810574001736,"h":0.010334142523246048,"y":0.4869186048506009,"text":"is a celebration of all the different foods from"},{"w":0.36213989257812496,"text":"Cheshire in the north of England. The festival also","y":0.50274725240592277,"h":0.013343799058084693,"x":0.082304539976369578},{"text":"supports local restaurants, farmers and food producers.","x":0.080246913138047812,"w":0.40329216851128469,"y":0.52034883750828764,"h":0.013081394896215293},{"w":0.34979424370659717,"x":0.082304521819540954,"y":0.53633720969215393,"text":"You can try some fantastic food and watch some","h":0.013113339991547068},{"text":"cooking demonstrations. There are also cooking classes","w":0.4012345716688368,"y":0.5537676609937604,"x":0.082304529880602065,"h":0.013092803805364706},{"h":0.011812730337050215,"w":0.38477366129557294,"x":0.08024692062107476,"text":"so you can prepare some dishes. It takes place in the","y":0.57103610674053584},{"h":0.013343799058084804,"x":0.082304542781943782,"text":"gardens of Walton Hall and only costs £2","y":0.58712715877375321,"w":0.30246910942925348},{"x":0.082304521808358469,"w":0.36625515407986109,"text":"per person. It's free for children under 12 years old","h":0.013081394896215404,"y":0.60319767464930529},{"h":0.014534882885320677,"text":"THE GREAT BRITISH FOOD FESTIVAL","x":0.078189294521872912,"y":0.65697674467652567,"w":0.40534979926215275},{"y":0.68014128746923852,"text":"is a fantastic event for all the family. Watch top","h":0.011773940345368938,"w":0.37242797851562504,"x":0.080246922230527512},{"y":0.6962209302189255,"text":"chefs cook, try amazing food from all over the","x":0.084362149755256341,"w":0.36419752332899302,"h":0.011785349254518351},{"w":0.35390943739149305,"x":0.08230454646200365,"h":0.011789912518751278,"y":0.71350078502395109,"text":"country and enjoy the many bands that play"},{"w":0.36625512017144102,"x":0.08230454478396379,"h":0.011773940345368938,"text":"there. There are several competitions, such as","y":0.72959183659920168},{"h":0.011627906907110019,"text":"the famous Cake Off. There's entertainment for","y":0.74709302348442952,"w":0.37242797851562504,"x":0.082304528677715677},{"text":"children too, including a magician. There's also a","y":0.76295133454151087,"w":0.38683125813802088,"h":0.011773940345368938,"x":0.082304529092855377},{"x":0.082304527699813737,"y":0.77904238611676158,"text":"market with crafts and T-shirts, tops and trousers.","h":0.011773940345368938,"w":0.39506171332465279},{"y":0.79651162791272412,"h":0.011627906907110019,"x":0.084362144393365701,"text":"A family ticket is £20 (two adults + two children).","w":0.38477366129557289},{"w":0.10699588351779514,"